+## 2. Provenance
+
+[Plan r4](literature-reading-reference-plan.md): Goal (LR3), §0 (R0.2, R0.4,
+R0.5), §1 (H12–H18, H24), §2 LR3, §3, §4 (LR3-C1 to C6), §6, §9, D1, D3, D4,
+D9. [#226](https://github.com/vasiloglou/gnd-public/issues/226) request 1.
