+`src/gnd/examples/literature/reading.py` (caller roots, `run`, `replay`,
+`ProducerCall`, `_response`, `_evaluate`), `reading_fixture/README.md`
+"Drive it from your host", `corpus/corpus.json`, `answers/answer-key.json`,
