+## 3. Obligations
+
+| Source | Obligation | Discharged in |
+|---|---|---|
+| H12; #226 request 1 | a reference recall and precision on a labelled set, with the stage settings | §6 run and score; T2, T3 |
+| H14 | #226's figures as the comparison row | §6 page |
