+- Whole-repository `uv run ruff check` exits 0 at `11a7ebf7`: **confirmed**.
+- Derivation failures set exit 1 (`_reports.py:113-116`): **confirmed**.
+- `assurance_report.py` reports precision and recall against an answer key:
